    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068850/extras/60257f0fc91fc881df8b7f4ab3b876ce.avif?t=1754898902\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Nameless machine, on a mission in a highly volatile world. A planet controlled by gruesome creatures, abusing and corrupting everything in their reach.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83e\udded Handcrafted World Made with Love for Detail</strong><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068850/extras/069cacd0f6e2f33521e34eea718bad3b.poster.avif?t=1754898902\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068850/extras/069cacd0f6e2f33521e34eea718bad3b.webm?t=1754898902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068850/extras/069cacd0f6e2f33521e34eea718bad3b.mp4?t=1754898902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>If the walls could talk - designed with careful attention to lore and pacing</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>An intricate web - interconnected locations, discoveries around every corner</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A living beast to tame - not a backdrop to a forgotten story</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Decorations become actors - interactivity and depth for emergent gameplay</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u2694\ufe0f A\ufe0f Dance With The Lions</strong><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068850/extras/5e399b5df738244b884123bb9dd608b2.poster.avif?t=1754898902\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068850/extras/5e399b5df738244b884123bb9dd608b2.webm?t=1754898902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068850/extras/5e399b5df738244b884123bb9dd608b2.mp4?t=1754898902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Choose your battles wisely - prepare before entering the cage</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fierce and insidious - read your enemies, react to the unforeseen</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Weighty and grounded - friendly fire turns enemies into tools</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You choose the genre - strike, shoot, and strategize your own way</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Earn Your Edge, Shape Your Style</strong><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068850/extras/56fea339a8a543f749767503e31d638d.poster.avif?t=1754898902\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068850/extras/56fea339a8a543f749767503e31d638d.webm?t=1754898902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068850/extras/56fea339a8a543f749767503e31d638d.mp4?t=1754898902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Every choice matters - the world is your skill tree, and resources are key</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Function over form - builds aren\u2019t mere numbers, they define how you play</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Leveling up is just fine tuning - gadgets and upgrades are the main course</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>From Zero to Hero - evolve from disposable piece of steel into a forged weapon of will</strong> </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udf00 Mind Over Matter</strong><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068850/extras/b4b34f89436f775cd1ef073933500feb.poster.avif?t=1754898902\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068850/extras/b4b34f89436f775cd1ef073933500feb.webm?t=1754898902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068850/extras/b4b34f89436f775cd1ef073933500feb.mp4?t=1754898902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>One force to move them all - accelerate yourself and nearby objects using a telekinetic field</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>What bullets? - deploy antikinetic waves to stop moving objects in their tracks</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Think fast, move faster - improvise deadly solutions using momentum and your surroundings</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Don\u2019t move around the problem, move the problem - solve physical puzzles on the fly</strong></p></li></ul>",
